    skos:altLabel "APPI"@en ;
    skos:definition "Direct ionization of molecules at atmospheric pressure by electron detachment induced by photons forming \\(\\ce{M^{+.}}\\), or atmospheric pressure chemical ionization in which the reactant ions are generated by photoionization of suitable dopant species and subsequent ion/molecule reactions of their molecular ions."@en ;
